Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the Aurichalcos will swallow\Nyou both, and it all starts with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A Magic card known as Aurichalcos Mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,which in turn calls four knights\Nto the field to protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your knights are only safe if your mirror\Nknight-calling magic card is in play!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, I'll squash it\Nwith Ring of Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, when your knights are\Ndestroyed, they can't come back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.81,0:00:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Recognize anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.97,0:00:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to defeat me without\Ndestroying these monsters. And you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.57,0:00:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,can't destroy my knights without\Ndestroying the souls of your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, gentlemen,\Nwhat do you think of my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,newest soldiers i'm sure\Nthere's no need for any
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.63,0:02:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Introductions? That's not\Nfunny. Darts maybe not too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you that's enough just drop\Nthe magic act and let's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,duel but we are dueling\Nyou insensible twit we're
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,just doing it by my rules\Nthat's all since i now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,control the souls of your\Nformer friends i thought
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be fun to let\Nthem play along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.95,0:02:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be thanking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you one last chance to see your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,companions before their\Nsouls are gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never take them\Naway from us, darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let your anger consume you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the darkness within\Nyou beginning to spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The stronger your rage,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.77,0:03:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the more powerful the great Leviathan\Nwill be when it absorbs your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where was I? Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Knight Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.31,0:03:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to attack your other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Yugi! Fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My soldier is still loyal to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you turned your back\Non him, he refuses to seek revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That will soon change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.61,0:03:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I lay a card face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you've\Ngot, Kyber. My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.05,0:03:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be\Nintimidated just because he
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,put a few familiar faces\Non his little soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll play my Pot\Nof Greed Magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,letting me draw twice, and then\NI'll activate my Cost Down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.37,0:04:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It lowers the level of a monster in my hand,\Nso I can summon it without a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.81,0:04:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I call to the field my\Ndifferent dimension dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to its special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,my dragon can't be destroyed by any\Nmonster with less than 1900 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, my Kaiser Glider can't\Nbe destroyed by your knights either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiser Glider!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Knight number three!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.27,0:04:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let some mind trick\Nstop me from winning this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That lunatic seized control of my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.49,0:04:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm prepared to do whatever\NI have to to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.53,0:04:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.05,0:04:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to stall us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And I told you it's not\Ngoing to work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.41,0:05:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If we let Darts win, then he'll capture\Nus and the whole planet will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we fight back, our\Nfriends will be lost forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.81,0:05:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've got a dweeb army.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to be scared to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, only if destroying an\Ninnocent soul concerns you. Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As the president of a major corporation,\NI have to do that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kaiser Glider, continue\Nyour attack on his Mirror Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes her Mirror Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That means one more attack and she's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Different Dimension\NDragon, attack her again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey saved her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he lost his shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.99,0:06:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's alright, thanks to Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and by sacrificing his\Nown shield to protect Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Joseph Wheeler just ruined your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures, Wheeler, mess things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.81,0:06:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you know what you\Nhave to do for us to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.23,0:06:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush Wheeler and Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't endanger them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither one of them has a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought with honor, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No evil shall penetrate me! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If his plan works,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts will have succeeded in\Nunleashing a truly devastating power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let this happen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm letting the seal take me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to put my friends in harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.83,0:07:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.79,0:07:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If the pharaoh doesn't attack,\Nthen Darts is going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll think of something, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:07:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's up to me to do what you couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I'll take a few life\Npoints, compliments of the Orichalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now on to your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't choose which one to\Nattack, then I'll choose for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll use this, the\Nmagic card twin bow centaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll pick two monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,One on my side of the\Nfield and one on yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, my Centaur will randomly choose\None of them to remove from the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll target Kaiba's Kaiser Glider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.77,0:08:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mirror Knight Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If that arrow removes Joey from the game,\Nwe'll never get him back! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.41,0:08:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it hits Seto, he'll\Nlose most of his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Or Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will it choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're the unlucky\None this time, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Settles! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to end\Nthings on such a sour note,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.37,0:09:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,so allow me to share with you\Nthe upside of this tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.79,0:09:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My card requires me to end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can do what your Siamese donkey\Ntwins should have done last turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.11,0:09:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove Joey Wheeler from the\Ngame once and for all! Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just save it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That second-rate chump has\Nheld me back for the last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Different Dimension Dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.61,0:09:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't do this! Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This time Yugi protected Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.55,0:09:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.07,0:09:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe friendship does conquer all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to your friends' loyalty to one\Nanother, I'll be able to conquer you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.31,0:09:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you use them\Nfor your own selfish scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Mystical Space Typhoon, which\Nremoves your centaur from the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn, you poor fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.41,0:10:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You just wasted your turn destroying a\Ncreature I didn't need. And wait till
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You see what I'm about to replace him\Nwith. I summon Obelisk the Tormentor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to the second layer\Nof the Sacred Seal My power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Increases by another 3,000 points.\NHe's got over 15,000. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and my brother's only got 600\NOne more attack and he's toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we both know what\Nhas to happen now, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't you fret, 'cause I'll make sure\Nthat soul of yours is put to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as soon as it's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ore Calcos Malevolence! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a real blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's Big Shield Gardener!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.45,0:11:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,However, my life points\Nare safe thanks to my Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.93,0:11:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And your pathetic Gardener is\Nforced to switch into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.99,0:12:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be true, but thanks to\NKaiba's trap card, your turn's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Must you explain everything? Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hope nothing happens to\Nme, cause you can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have 600 points left, and there's\Nnot a monster in my hand I can summon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll switch my\Ndragon into defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll end my turn by\Nplacing two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to win this duel, you're\Ngonna have to attack those Mirror Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't turn my back on Yugi again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.85,0:12:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't attack, you'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And too many people are depending on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Yugi, if any of you are attacked,\Nyour souls may be lost forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize you're talking to\Na hologram with your head on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, once again, you're clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh Everyone is\Nwaiting First I'll switch
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.41,0:13:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,my big shield Gardner\Nback into defense mode
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, I shall end my turn\NPlease tell me this is a joke
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.21,0:13:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite apparent that\Nthere's nothing either of you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,can do to stop me So let's put\Nyou out of your misery, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look happy to see me,\Nand after all we've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,where's the love don't answer that\Ni've heard enough lies from you the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh opened me up to the truth\Nreally yeah really thanks to him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,i was able to escape the seal of\Norichalcos with my soul still intact
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.81,0:14:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike them and everyone else you used.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now set them free before\Nyou end up on that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul may have been spared,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but it sounds like the Aurichalcos\Ntook what was left of your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.51,0:14:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.13,0:14:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It means you're more gullible than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think the darkness\Nthat once controlled you is gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.89,0:14:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh sent me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did he just trick you the\Nway you think I did? Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're messing with my head. Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.49,0:14:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I'm just trying to show you that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you're just like everyone\Nelse in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is\Nlook around you, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one of these poor\Nfools gave in to their
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,dark side and was taken\Nby the seal of Orichalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They're evil, just like all humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why I was\Nchosen to wipe them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just walk\Naway from the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I hired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.03,0:15:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your rage made you the perfect\Ncandidate to carry out my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.17,0:15:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I'm through being\Nangry with the world. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh and his friends reminded me\Nwhat loyalty and trust are all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to be like them\Nbefore you came into my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,life and poisoned my\Nmind with the Orychalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Orychalcos didn't poison your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.79,0:15:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It exposed what you\Ntruly are on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A corrupt human being full of anger,\Njust like everyone else in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.43,0:15:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that make you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you might say I'm a pioneer chosen\Nby the Orichalcos to carve out a new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And my task is nearly done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.55,0:15:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll have enough power to awaken\Nthe Leviathan and rebuild civilization!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For 10,000 years I've been\Ngathering the spirits of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,mankind to amass enough energy\Nto regenerate the great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But time was running\Nout, and I needed help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.11,0:16:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So you found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I required three subordinates\Nto carry out my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They needed to be filled with enough anger\Nto tap the full power of the Orycalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They also needed a reason to hate the\Npeople of this world as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I encountered\NValon, Alistair, and yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that I had found exactly\Nwhat I had been searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.65,0:16:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it was necessary to\Ninfluence certain events in your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, influence?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I see I'm going to need\Nto spell this out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His family was captured\Nby Gozaburo Kaiba's tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,during his effort to\Ntake over their township.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.07,0:17:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that story true, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.41,0:17:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What Alistair doesn't know is that\NKaiba's father didn't do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.01,0:17:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That armor belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have done\Nthis without you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there's poor Valon, who practically\Ngrew up in a juvenile detention center.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks once again to yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I framed him for his first\Ncrime at the age of nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.01,0:17:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course we can't\Nforget about you, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that stormy night. Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.15,0:18:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your captain didn't take\Nyou into that typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It was I who led your ship astray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.17,0:18:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.35,0:18:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to have to start\Npaying attention one of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I watched you master duel\Nmonsters at a young age,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but I needed to unlock your inner fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.11,0:18:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the only way to make sure\Nthat you were strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I had the three legendary\Ndragons to contend with now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And quite frankly, your\Nlife was a bit too perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So I made some adjustments.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.47,0:18:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You took me from my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your thirst for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You ruined my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the seal of Orycalchos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I didn't see\Nanyone play that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Guardian Iathos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael, control your anger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.57,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stop the seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Orb lives within him and\Ncan never be extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Its glow burns in his heart, and I'm\Nafraid there's no turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.27,0:19:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,His soul belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.25,0:20:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.45,0:20:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Another soul, another step closer\Nto awakening the great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.05,0:20:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this ends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How right you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.69,0:20:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just about done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I play this card,\Nyour fate will be sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.45,0:20:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,For the seal of Orichalcos is\Nabout to become even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.43,0:20:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to, darts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's time to experience\Nthe third level of darkness. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.09,0:20:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Orichalcos Tritos!
